# Design stack

Load skill: `skills/design-stack/SKILL.md`  
Manifest: `docs/knowledge-base/DESIGN-STACK-MANIFEST.md`  
Squad routing: `agents/squad-design.md`

## Full matrix (artifact → tool)

| Слой | Что | Когда |
|------|-----|--------|
| **Mock primary** | Stitch MCP + `skills/stitch-shadcn-ui` | Быстрые UI mockups |
| **Компоненты** | `skills/shadcn` (CLI first); fallback `skills/21st-design` + Magic MCP | Web app / blocks |
| **Figma** | `plugin-figma-figma` / `user-figma` | D2C / create file when MCP live |
| **Anti-slop web** | `skills/frontend-design` (**required gate**) | Любой web UI / landing / dashboard |
| **Taste depth** | `skills/design-taste-frontend` | Landings / portfolios |
| **Polish / critique** | `skills/impeccable` | Craft / audit / polish pass |
| **Guidelines / a11y** | `skills/web-design-guidelines` | Review vs Vercel Web Interface Guidelines |
| **React stack / CRO** | `skills/design-stack` + this rule | Tailwind/shadcn/fonts/CRO |
| **Deck / HTML / PPTX** | `skills/huashu-design` | Не React-код |
| **Clone landing** | `skills/clone-website` + browser | Копия сайта |
| **UX checklist** | `skills/ui-ux-pro-max` | Audit UX до handoff |
| **DESIGN.md** | `skills/awesome-design-md` | Design system docs |
| **Video motion** | `skills/remotion`, `skills/production-studio` | Motion/Reels |
| **Copy** | humanizer | Клиентский RU текст |
| **Personas (max 1)** | agency `@ui-designer` / `@brand-guardian` / `@whimsy-injector` | Глубина |

## Priority order

1. **frontend-design** gate for any web UI
2. **shadcn** CLI / registry; 21st Magic as browse/install aid
3. **taste** / **impeccable** / **guidelines** as needed
4. **context7** + **iconify** for docs/icons
5. **huashu-design** when not React
6. Custom Tailwind — last resort

## Handoff to Build

Echo: `Applied: [skill1, skill2, …]` + anti-slop checklist (aesthetic, type, palette, motion, differentiation).

